      "en": "Now the cherubim stood on the right side of the house when the man went in; and the cloud filled the inner court.",
      "ko": "그 사람이 들어갈 때에 그룹들은 성전 우편에 섰고 구름은 안 뜰에 가득하며",
      "source_text_hash": "32d55f21d3a4c0b2c5636f8eb773ad9ad9d3bd1d3afac8e45e75b2523ee15127",
      "translation_text_hash": "8c3068a8bd0303c719fae630b50d5c43e45ee756abee29cfc483a3aeeab024ac",
