      "en": "The sound of the wings of the cherubim was heard even to the outer court, as the voice of God Almighty when he speaks.",
      "ko": "그룹들의 날개 소리는 바깥 뜰까지 들리는데 전능하신 하나님의 말씀하시는 음성 같더라",
      "source_text_hash": "1093f4785563fc80871ff680669e833fd22645447b36c6f5f7f77a8ae2c8ccd7",
      "translation_text_hash": "2d929ebd9bb7dadf7d72d0af5d0b4bb22510dd46081513aa072e79ba5c33a179",
