      "en": "The cherub stretched out his hand from between the cherubim to the fire that was between the cherubim, and took some of it, and put it into the hands of him who was clothed in linen, who took it and went out.",
      "ko": "한 그룹이 그룹들 사이에서 손을 내밀어 그 그룹들 사이에 있는 불을 취하여 가는 베옷 입은 자의 손에 주매 그가 받아 가지고 나가는데",
      "source_text_hash": "7ca2b93331236374f3dacc5a9175616d3cd3f1932302c1200ec45224d30145bc",
      "translation_text_hash": "d6f79386cedb8e9c96a157fd2fb4dea85a11b94bfb8f8d1cc5f2ea65f1352ec5",
