      "en": "As for their appearance, the four of them had one likeness, like a wheel within a wheel.",
      "ko": "그 모양은 넷이 한결 같은데 마치 바퀴 안에 바퀴가 있는것 같으며",
      "source_text_hash": "bbd150662157ebb46f499b88fa1100190f4a7574214982814015cc3c4b282001",
